# `loro-crdt` is the one module that must ship UNBUNDLED: its Node build requires a
# `.wasm` file next to itself, which a bundle cannot carry. Only the Node build and
# the manifest that points `require` at it — the browser/bundler/web builds are dead
# weight in an extension host. `vsce package` must therefore NOT pass
# `--no-dependencies`, which drops node_modules wholesale.
